[{"title":"舟中独坐次邵诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"一棹初逢积雨晴，客边赢得寸心清。\n地偏时喜北风软，天迥独看西日明。\n怀古正贪诗逸响，可人更听橹柔声。\n寻常自有无穷妙，争奈浮生识未精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中即事 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"蓬户青灯照夜长，观星玩月水云乡。\n候当小雪寒犹浅，十月初旬始降霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中即事 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"风劲天高夜已霜，孤蓬閒倚面朝阳。\n移湾细忆曾游处，静听吾伊昼满航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万石渡舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"抄书曾作豫章行，记得扁舟夜此停。\n异日重来头尽雪，不堪惆怅忆平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟近豫章","author":"吴与弼","text":"双橹和鸣莫景横，相将喜见豫章城。\n病躯粗健何妨老，随处高歌颂太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家书","author":"吴与弼","text":"乡人逢处话乡心，明发西归送好音。\n我在客边安所遇，家庭只管惜分阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"船头晓立","author":"吴与弼","text":"樯头晓对豫章城，南浦西山是旧盟。\n俯仰古今云聚散，新题何处独凝情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉柬大司成先生令嗣","author":"吴与弼","text":"未遂生刍一束忱，白杨几感老怀深。\n金昆玉季停云处，攀折江东渭北情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬伍伯逊","author":"吴与弼","text":"拟向高轩一日留，碧梧翠竹共绸缪。\n觉来懒慢休相讶，老病人扶不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写家书后作寄璿子 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"今日慈颜值令辰，满门和气想氤氲。\n江山到处逢迎好，不必多情忆远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写家书后作寄璿子 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"晏子传书久达家，诸孙亲果任喧哗。\n慇勤寄语青灯伴，逐日新功好倍加。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又柬伯逊","author":"吴与弼","text":"闻道高轩迟我过，别离偏感老怀多。\n片帆岂不相思切，其奈馀魂逆旅何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"吴与弼","text":"辗转寒更梦不成，细思时止与时行。\n蹉跎徒有男儿志，枉向尘寰老此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发豫章","author":"吴与弼","text":"挂席西归孺子亭，小春阳煦快舆情。\n满怀今古凭谁问，独对寒山一带青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昌邑山舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"红日衔山莫景明，扬舲共喜夜风生。\n中天月好长湖稳，五六云帆作伴行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"船头对月偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"笃斯懿德任吾真，宁计朝晡苦与辛。\n黄卷两行歌一曲，陶然日作葛天民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜读","author":"吴与弼","text":"听罢吾伊宵向残，月明清兴正相关。\n近贪黄卷多新益，独对韩檠又一摊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"吴与弼","text":"清夜迢迢境阒然，百年心事在韦编。\n可堪夙志浑孤负，空得浮生雪满颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿珠玑湖","author":"吴与弼","text":"閒从火伴问名湖，愧乏珠玑媚此都。\n一水浮空帆暝漠，孤烟带野树模糊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴罢歌邵子诗","author":"吴与弼","text":"羁思乡心近若何，吾伊声罢听云和。\n美兹明月清风夜，细唱阳春白雪歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"辞家已是一旬馀，试把新诗讯起居。\n待足求安元有诫，日凭青简味真腴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟近浔阳郭追次辛丑岁游此诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"霜日融融昼梦馀，身閒随处是安居。\n万缘有分无劳计，频向麟经玩特书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读春秋","author":"吴与弼","text":"尘网那胜久陆沉，青灯遥夜照孤吟。\n化工妙契何由得，慷慨平生尽笔心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中閒眺","author":"吴与弼","text":"巑岏翠壁倚云端，红树人家带碧湍。\n偶尔会心为客处，只疑身在梦中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次磐塘","author":"吴与弼","text":"整履聊为泽畔吟，前村独往事幽寻。\n衡茅细接穷阎话，又感平生生物心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夜次工部落日平台韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"旅棹无眠夜，寒衾独咏诗。\n江湖今日兴，宇宙昔人诗。\n蠛蠓身如梦，蜉蝤鬓久丝。\n冬来多雨雪，骥子念瓜期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄磉舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"好山奇绝自天开，道上谁人入壮怀。\n我惜桑榆难再赋，只应图画共徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔阳口追次辛丑岁诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"琴书又泛楚江舟，年少题诗今白头。\n绿水青山新唱和，雪泥鸿爪旧朋游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿散花轩乡人索诗","author":"吴与弼","text":"野水荒洲宿散花，乡心羁思共天涯。\n明朝再得东风便，去住留诗属及瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜说中庸","author":"吴与弼","text":"旧学荒凉偶一燖，悠悠空志百年心。\n慇勤谁向吾儿道，圣者犹闻惜寸阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次未起程时枕上所作韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"少日深惟道是忧，老来愈觉德难脩。\n几于名教徘徊处，剔尽残灯未忍休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听诵孟子三乐章","author":"吴与弼","text":"一听邹书三乐辞，肃容敛衽起遐思。\n系天人处犹能得，自致云何不念兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄进贤吕茂宰","author":"吴与弼","text":"台皂劳觇久，车舆出饯隆。\n趋承惭有道，观感激颓风。\n白发人何补，青云气正雄。\n题诗江汉上，翘首豫章东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李晏诸生","author":"吴与弼","text":"湖海扁舟远，园林数子劳。\n丹诚怜尔辈，玉案愧吾曹。\n昨夜金沙目，何时汝水舠。\n綵云连集庆，细酌盍簪醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"淹泊依沙岸，栖迟枕碧湍。\n遥空风势远，竟夜雨声寒。\n幸免蓬窗虑，欣投栋宇宽。\n明朝重汛扫，笔砚共平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"独拨寒更火，频挑旅次灯。\n怀人方有赋，观我澹忘形。\n变态能相好，乡心不用萦。\n情知旋旆日，定在一阳生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"湖上风威盛，云边夜气清。\n晚来收细雨，更尽见孤星。\n久客休相念，明朝定放晴。\n兴阑眠未得，次第觅诗成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"深夜仍飞雨，诘朝未放晴。\n疾风吹地转，高浪蹴云平。\n翰墨充人事，琴书理性情。\n为知萍梗迹，日咏此郊坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其五","author":"吴与弼","text":"病后新功减，閒来旧梦清。\n闭门终日坐，抚景百年情。\n道大诗书重，身恬去就轻。\n寸心何所系，潦止霁斯行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其六","author":"吴与弼","text":"雨雪时惊户，风涛益撼空。\n残杯初泛绿，衰火却添红。\n玉轸调应罢，尘编兴未穷。\n化工何处觅，江汉正朝宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其七","author":"吴与弼","text":"平野风收怒，高天日露华。\n怀人阻石首，作客且金沙。\n店黍聊供饭，园蔬可当茶。\n拟乘明发兴，访旧遍邻家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其八","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶踏新晴好，宁教逸兴悭。\n悠悠江夏水，隐隐汉阳山。\n野趣方延伫，柴扃未拟还。\n薇垣来旧侣，携手重乡关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其九","author":"吴与弼","text":"孤洁瞻新月，高明仰列星。\n阴霾知几日，此去想多情。\n寡欲存神妙，忘机养性灵。\n残编寒漏永，至教在麟经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其十","author":"吴与弼","text":"月淡天如水，霞明露已霜。\n畦蔬舒晚翠，篱菊傲孤芳。\n琴剑仍文事，江山且武昌。\n閒窗宜养病，未用说吾乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其十一","author":"吴与弼","text":"谁道心如面，今人即古人。\n公卿能下士，观感尽兴仁。\n寓迹金沙上，新亭野水滨。\n题诗渐卤莽，孤负秉彝真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其十二","author":"吴与弼","text":"共诧金沙胜，衣冠日日来。\n高情知好德，薄分愧非才。\n绿水春光动，青山霁景开。\n樯头宾不顾，端似舞雩回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其十三","author":"吴与弼","text":"綵笔晴挥罢，澄江晚眺时。\n生涯从作客，物态尽归诗。\n乡侣新情密，柴关独返迟。\n经过多爱惜，次第见民彝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金沙杂诗 其十四","author":"吴与弼","text":"钟鼓候和鸣，衣冠迟夙兴。\n钧天万寿日，大地一阳生。\n礼乐沾清化，车书荷圣情。\n金沙留胜迹，曾此贺升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼梦觉作","author":"吴与弼","text":"时光已是阳生后，归计应当昼梦馀。\n天外琴书虽乐土，山中松竹乃吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周长史崇德堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"棘垣拔秀亦云终，花萼联辉谊正隆。\n不是德馨宁致此，百千似续固宜崇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邱布政公馀十咏","author":"吴与弼","text":"冉冉晴云漾楚天，滔滔新涨下岷川。\n欲知退食委蛇妙，听唱阳春白雪篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘佥宪挹清轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"载籍馀芳漱有年，台临丽泽更泠然。\n天光云影徘徊处，拟共何人赋此轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廖教授求箴语","author":"吴与弼","text":"兴戎出好片辞间，利害分明欲顺难。\n从此书绅宜痛省，扩充四勿日希颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归兴","author":"吴与弼","text":"觅得江头汝水船，朝来归兴已翩翩。\n乡山故旧逢迎处，细说名邦馆谷贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别武昌","author":"吴与弼","text":"羁怀窃幸一身强，又喜琴书别武昌。\n借问同舟人客姓，新晴作伴好还乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发兰溪","author":"吴与弼","text":"共讶宵来雨打篷，深忧舴艋困途穷。\n诘朝忽喜东方好，大地曈曈青满空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卦口 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"流光又值大寒时，清夜閒吟卦口诗。\n薄暮江头疏雨歇，云开莫怪月来迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卦口 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"青山日日数归期，江上扁舟去尚迟。\n夜半疾风雷雨作，孤衾卦口梦醒时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿南湖觜","author":"吴与弼","text":"共喜西风好，何嫌夜柁劳。\n更阑雨脚断，云薄月华高。\n慰劳频分果，丁宁稳着篙。\n邻舟灯火近，杙缆向江皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"康山","author":"吴与弼","text":"北风条畅一帆轻，西日红明又报晴。\n翘望乡园程尚远，康山新兴共谁乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蔗林","author":"吴与弼","text":"已喜归帆逗蔗林，新晴尤惬客边心。\n云笺挥罢如椽笔，又向平沙事短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发桂林","author":"吴与弼","text":"浮空瑞色晓皑皑，半挂云帆带雪开。\n夜梦家庭勤汛扫，亦知早晚客归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凿石潭怀廖广文","author":"吴与弼","text":"青毡已辱温存厚，花被何当过爱多。\n微吟凿石潭边枕，细忆金沙洲上歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿黄城艾氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"借得银鞍冒雨行，投装仍访旧门生。\n时逢相识绵绵话，总是乡关故国情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄家原道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"出得黄城望故山，皇华近在翠微间。\n回头旧友遥追逐，细酌芸窗慰客颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归来","author":"吴与弼","text":"归来松菊总平安，墙角梅花雪后看。\n新锦堂中春昼永，清谈日接故人欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦","author":"吴与弼","text":"履端莫怪起来迟，老病身衰只自知。\n俯仰乡关多暇日，万方钟鼓乐清时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日承李贾二县侯下顾","author":"吴与弼","text":"湖海归来百虑轻，梅花仍结岁寒盟。\n联翩更辱贤侯趾，锦绣重增白屋荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞家口占授小儿及诸生","author":"吴与弼","text":"适楚归来又适闽，桃溪柳涧踏清晨。\n服膺素有前贤命，流水行云任我真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙坊道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"桃李漫村麦陇肥，吟边春思转霏微。\n未了平生山水债，寸心遥向七闽飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10315,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南原道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"出得平田问地名，望中时见旧山青。\n林头忽喜诗情好，深树红芳在杳冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10316,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿杨溪","author":"吴与弼","text":"衣冠先后辱遥迎，一笑春风故里情。\n生意望迷平野迥，老年人在梦中行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10317,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼梦觉作","author":"吴与弼","text":"冥冥细雨滞行装，且复高眠向北窗。\n识得静中滋味别，始知禅客最为忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10318,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题彭原李氏门扉","author":"吴与弼","text":"宿雨初收踏好晴，匆匆行李促严程。\n东风吹我彭原袂，何限先师执友情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10319,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小憩游顿寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶从花下一閒吟，窗户玲珑竹树深。\n习习条风知客意，特来清我出尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10320,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿太原寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"午咏招提游顿花，太原更宿老禅家。\n病躯偏爱幽栖好，高枕虚堂皓月华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10321,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿太平寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"春风一宿太平禅，桃李芳菲霁月圆。\n明发青山怀雪爪，笋舆人在白云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10322,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]